getflag u1 "u1"
getflag u2 "u2"
getflag u3 "u3"
getflag u4 "u4"
sensor t1 refabricator1 @team
sensor t2 refabricator2 @team
sensor t3 refabricator3 @team
sensor t4 assembler1 @team
jump 10 notEqual t1 3
control enabled refabricator1 u1 0 0 0
jump 12 notEqual t2 3
control enabled refabricator2 u2 0 0 0
jump 14 notEqual t3 3
control enabled refabricator3 u3 0 0 0
jump 16 notEqual t4 3
control enabled assembler1 u4 0 0 0
end
